@host = https://localhost:7043
@deviceId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@apiCredential = replace-with-monitoring-read-credential

### Metric sources from raw and retained five-minute history.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/host-metrics/series?from=2026-01-01T00%3A00%3A00Z&until=2027-01-01T00%3A00%3A00Z&kind=CpuTotalPercent&page=0
Authorization: Bearer {{apiCredential}}
